# CogniGuard frontend environment variables
#
# Copy this file to:
#   - frontend/.env.local  -> for local development (optional)
#   - Vercel project Settings -> Environment Variables (production)
#
# IMPORTANT: NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are baked into the JavaScript bundle at build time,
# so set this BEFORE you run `vercel build` / before Vercel rebuilds the project.

# URL of the deployed backend API (Render/Railway/etc).
# Example for a Render service named "cogniguard-api":
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://cogniguard-api.onrender.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:5000